  "body": "Welcome to 20 Moko Road, Orewa - a brand-new, single-level home where thoughtful design, quality finishes and effortless living come together beautifully.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a generous open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a light-filled and welcoming space for everyday living and entertaining. The designer kitchen makes an immediate impression with its large island, distinctive finishes, excellent storage and walk-in pantry, seamlessly combining style with genuine practicality.\r\n\r\nOne of the home’s standout features is the private central deck, with direct access from the kitchen and two bedrooms. This clever layout creates seamless indoor- outdoor flow and a sheltered retreat for morning coffee, relaxed entertaining or quiet evenings at home. A second elevated deck captures an open outlook across the\r\nsurrounding neighbourhood, providing another inviting outdoor space to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThree generous bedrooms are complemented by two beautifully appointed bathrooms, including a stylish master ensuite. Underfloor heating in both bathrooms adds everyday comfort, while the family bathroom features a luxurious freestanding bath. Feature tiling, warm timber tones and carefully selected finishes bring a distinctive sense of style and quality throughout the home.\r\n\r\nFeatures You’ll Love:\r\n\r\n• Three generous bedrooms and two stylish bathrooms\r\n•  Brand-new, single-level home on a freehold title\r\n•  Spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n•  Designer kitchen with a large island and walk-in pantry\r\n•  Private central deck with access from the kitchen and two bedrooms\r\n•  Second elevated deck with an open neighbourhood outlook\r\n•  Underfloor heating in both bathrooms\r\n•  Family bathroom with a luxurious freestanding bath\r\n•  Central ducted air conditioning throughout\r\n•  Separate laundry with a built-in washing tub\r\n•  Dedicated off-street parking\r\n•  Easy-care, low-maintenance section\r\n•  10-Year Master Build Guarantee for added peace of mind\r\n\r\nViewing Directions:\r\n\r\nEnter 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa into your GPS. Turn left at the roundabout ahead, then enter the development when you see the Strathmill sign. Follow the directional signs to 20 Moko Road.\r\n\r\nSet within Orewa’s exciting new Strathmill community, the home is close to Orewa Beach, schools, shops, cafés and motorway access. Ideal for downsizers, couples, retirees or small families seeking stylish, low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your viewing.",
